{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p030a","title":"辛毗等上言天命劝进","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p030a-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"辛毗等上言天命劝进","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0071","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0306","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0079","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0395","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0072","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0394","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0080","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0081","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年受禅前","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年受禅前"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p030a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p030a-q","source_order":[2,143,"P030a"],"order":518}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0071","name":"刘晔","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0072","name":"陈矫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0079","name":"卫臻","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0080","name":"苏林","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0081","name":"董巴","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0203","name":"辛毗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0306","name":"傅巽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0394","name":"陈群","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0395","name":"桓阶","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-p030a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-5174c3cb0d47f5332e81","layer":"pei","quote":"于是侍中辛毗、刘晔，散骑常侍傅巽、卫臻，尚书令桓阶，尚书陈矫、陈群，给事中、博士、骑都尉苏林、董巴等奏曰：“伏见太史丞许芝上魏国受命之符；令书恳切，允执谦让，虽舜、禹、汤、文，义无以过。然古先哲王所以受天命而不辞者，诚急遵皇天之意，副兆民之望，弗得已也。且《易》曰：‘观乎天文以察时变，观乎人文以化成天下。’又曰：‘天垂象，见吉凶，圣人则之；河出《图》，洛出《书》，圣人效之。’以为天文因人而变；至于河洛之《书》，著于《洪范》，则殷、周效而用之矣。斯言，诚帝王之明符，天道之大要也。是以由德应录者，代兴于前；失道数尽者，迭废于后。《传》讥苌弘欲支天之所坏，而说蔡墨‘雷乘乾’之说；明神器之存亡，非人力所能建也。今汉室衰替，帝纲堕坠；天子之诏，歇灭无闻；皇天将舍旧而命新，百姓既去汉而为魏；昭然著明，是可知也。先王拨乱平世，将建洪基；至于殿下，以至德当历数之运。即位以来，天应人事，粲然大备；神灵图籍，兼仍往古；休征嘉兆，跨越前代。是芝所取《中黄》、《运期》姓（纬）〔讳〕之谶，斯文乃著于前世，与汉并见。由是言之，天命久矣，非殿下所得而拒之也。神明之意，候望禋享；兆民颙颙，咸注嘉愿。惟殿下览图籍之明文，急天下之公义；辄宣令外内，布告州郡，使知符命著明而殿下谦虚之意。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":142,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":534,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
